Cold girl makeup for a day on Herschel Island, Yukon Territory❄️

This island was once a whaling village, and today it’s cared for and protected by the Inuvialuit people.

I was fortunate to try on an Amauti, an Arctic parka trimmed with wolf and wolverine fur that keeps the frost off and has been a staple for the Inuvialuit for generations. It was soooo warm and cozy!! 

